{"id":"588e8fcba7d283dc","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-normal-form.md","title":"GL Normal Form Lemma","display":"lem-gl-normal-form — GL Normal Form Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-normal-form","aliases":["89-lem-gl-normal-form"],"display":"lem-gl-normal-form — GL Normal Form Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-gl-decomposition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-normal-form — GL Normal Form Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" href=\"?note=0b3c8928cef7eaa4\" title=\"89-df-gl-normal-form\">89-df-gl-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db8da4f25311c498\" href=\"?note=db8da4f25311c498\" title=\"89-lem-gl-decomposition\">89-lem-gl-decomposition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the GL normal-form class.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 GL 公式都有一个 GL 等价的正规形</li>\n<li>正规形式便于算术解释</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"0b3c8928cef7eaa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-decomposition","status":"resolved","id":"db8da4f25311c498","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-decomposition]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\mathrm{NF}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n(A\\leftrightarrow N)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true}],"bytes":820,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","0b3c8928cef7eaa4","db8da4f25311c498"]}